        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electric motor, for electric passenger car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electric motor, for electric passenger car
This dataset describes an electric motor used for an electric passenger car. It is based on direct information from the Swiss manufacturer Brusa. The electric motor has a maximal output power of about 100kW The entries are given as a function of kg device. The specific motor which was used for this dataset weights 53 kg.;
UUID: f937e3b1-e1ee-32f8-b582-8a044ad51323
&lt;null&gt;
Location: Unspecified
Technology: This dataset is based on current, high-level standard.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 477000 kg
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Data on materials and technology has been provided directly by the Swiss manufacturer Brusa. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f937e3b1-e1ee-32f8-b582-8a044ad51323.xml</text>
